  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves, pounded to an even thickness",
    "3 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "2 cups thinly sliced mushrooms",
    "2 tablespoons dry white wine",
    "1.5 cups prepared chicken gravy",
    "1 cup half-and-half",
    "1.5 tablespoons Dijon mustard",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RtjDI6WBNYQ2hp7sl7gfT9NRaGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-01-111ee609e25d44439e65c50de9aeea1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour milk into a wide, shallow bowl. Spread flour into a separate wide, shallow bowl. Dip each chicken breast half into milk to coat; move to the dish with flour and press chicken into flour to coat entirely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vIlcWANafmLSGYVQ6uphvVngmMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-02-1a4e5a6c6f964bb896606015d60b091c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Fry chicken in hot oil until golden brown, about 3 minutes per side. Remove chicken to a plate; drain fat from the skillet and return to medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ws7KKiH0U8Ut00RPGRkj77tnl_4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-03-1-743f1f1f16294b21bd191edf7b9c12d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the skillet. Sauté mushrooms in hot butter until softened, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kOSHzJuX8Kt4wfJpZY89drJHQAA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-04-0a9641e6c52b401793b2e22938ef3cbf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour white wine over mushrooms. Stir gravy, half-and-half, and mustard with mushrooms; season with salt and pepper. Bring the liquid to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zptl-9BbiktweZn1OmyffxyVwGI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-05-8817efc2475a4fe0a0d0463c5f9550cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return chicken to the skillet and cook until chicken is no longer pink in the center and juices run clear, about 5 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZmdVrfuDX-MbHc8uDwIYGcfMVlQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240704-chicken-mushroom-dijon-VAT-step-06-1-5ae9be1566184212af6ee5caaae3be15.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240704/step_06.webp"
    }
